{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935290?t=1756241330","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/65fea149919734f7b8108c365cd3cc10729b0b3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756241330","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/e611a9822e459b9d806322a33761f166dff815d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756241330","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/e611a9822e459b9d806322a33761f166dff815d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756241330","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ghost Code: Escape&quot; is the humble beginnings of a new saga. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a relatively simple 2D platformer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breezy Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the 18 stages can be completed in under 30 seconds, but mastering them can be a challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't use tiled environments. Every stage is handcrafted as a singular art piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peek into a New World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story isn't front and center, but it is an origin of sorts for a big player in the world of Ghost Code.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's 100% free, so give it a try.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crimson Equation"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935290/8152ca471b0a5f8b9e1dcf87e25f4119965ab898/header.jpg?t=1756241330","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257178847,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178847/movie480.mp4?t=1756241328","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178847/movie_max.mp4?t=1756241328"},"name":"Ghost Code: Escape Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178847/018ce3d7bfa43ad535ce7087d3430162e6faf555/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756241328","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178847/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756241328","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178847/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756241328"}}],"name":"Ghost Code: Escape","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage